  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BoV and NV run a project &quot;Towards a sustainable developm - enviroment goals and indicators&quot; 7 case studies in Swedish municipalities, 3 thematic studies and 2 studies in Kimerley and Port Elisabeth (the last two only supported by Sida). The project also receives support from EU&apos;sLIFE fund.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BoV o NV driver ett proj &quot;F&#xf6;r en b&#xe4;rkraftig samhutv - milj&#xf6;m&#xe5;l och indikatorer i fys planering&quot; Fallstudier i 7 sv kommuner o RTK samt 3 te-mastudier; milj&#xf6;m&#xe5;l o fys strukturer, Strategisk milj&#xf6;bed&#xf6;mn o GIS. I Sidas st&#xf6;d ing&#xe5;r ocks&#xe5; en studie hur indikatorer kan anv&#xe4;ndas i &#xf6;ver- siktplanering i Kimberley och Port Elisabeth.</narrative>
  </description>
